{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"申命记","commonName":"申命记","title":"申命记","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"35327388dd3d83dc5cbf3bb3b8e1fb1773933284ab37065518e57d824ed6b819","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":951},"chapter":{"number":32,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"诸天哪，侧耳，我要说话；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿地也听我口中的言语。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的教训要淋漓如雨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的言语要滴落如露，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如细雨降在嫩草上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如甘霖降在菜蔬中。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要宣告耶和华的名；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要将大德归与我们的 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"他是磐石，他的作为完全；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他所行的无不公平，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是诚实无伪的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又公义，又正直。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这乖僻弯曲的世代向他行事邪僻；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有这弊病就不是他的儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚昧无知的民哪，你们这样报答耶和华吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他岂不是你的父、将你买来的吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他是制造你、建立你的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"你当追想上古之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"思念历代之年；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"问你的父亲，他必指示你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"问你的长者，他必告诉你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至高者将地业赐给列邦，将世人分开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就照以色列人的数目立定万民的疆界。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华的分本是他的百姓；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的产业本是雅各。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"耶和华遇见他在旷野—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"荒凉野兽吼叫之地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就环绕他，看顾他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"保护他，如同保护眼中的瞳人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如鹰搅动巢窝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在雏鹰以上两翅搧展，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"接取雏鹰，背在两翼之上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这样，耶和华独自引导他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并无外邦神与他同在。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华使他乘驾地的高处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"得吃田间的土产；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又使他从磐石中咂蜜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"从坚石中吸油；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也吃牛的奶油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羊的奶，羊羔的脂油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊所出的公绵羊和山羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"与上好的麦子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也喝葡萄汁酿的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"但耶书 渐渐肥胖，粗壮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"光润，踢跳，奔跑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便离弃造他的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"轻看救他的磐石；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"敬拜别神，触动 神的愤恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行可憎恶的事，惹了他的怒气。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所祭祀的鬼魔并非真神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是素不认识的神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是近来新兴的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你列祖所不畏惧的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你轻忽生你的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘记产你的 神。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"耶和华看见他的儿女惹动他，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就厌恶他们，说：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要向他们掩面，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看他们的结局如何。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们本是极乖僻的族类，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中无诚实的儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们以那「不算为神」的触动我的愤恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以虚无的神惹了我的怒气。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也要以那「不成子民」的触动他们的愤恨，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以愚昧的国民惹了他们的怒气。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为在我怒中有火烧起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直烧到极深的阴间，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把地和地的出产尽都焚烧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"山的根基也烧着了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"我要将祸患堆在他们身上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把我的箭向他们射尽。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必因饥饿消瘦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被炎热苦毒吞灭。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要打发野兽用牙齿咬他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并土中腹行的，用毒气害他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外头有刀剑，内室有惊恐，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使人丧亡，使少男、童女、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃奶的、白发的，尽都灭绝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我说，我必将他们分散远方，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使他们的名号从人间除灭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟恐仇敌惹动我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"只怕敌人错看，说：是我们手的能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并非耶和华所行的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"因为以色列民毫无计谋，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"心中没有聪明。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惟愿他们有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"能明白这事，肯思念他们的结局。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是他们的磐石卖了他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是耶和华交出他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一人焉能追赶他们千人？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二人焉能使万人逃跑呢？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"据我们的仇敌自己断定，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的磐石不如我们的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的葡萄树是所多玛的葡萄树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"蛾摩拉田园所生的；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的葡萄是毒葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"全挂都是苦的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的酒是大蛇的毒气，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是虺蛇残害的恶毒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"text":"这不都是积蓄在我这里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"封锁在我府库中吗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们失脚的时候，伸冤报应在我；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他们遭灾的日子近了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那要临在他们身上的必速速来到。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华见他百姓毫无能力，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无论困住的、自由的都没有剩下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必为他们伸冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为他的仆人后悔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他必说：他们的神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们所投靠的磐石，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是向来吃他们祭牲的脂油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝他们奠祭之酒的，在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他可以兴起帮助你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"护卫你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"text":"你们如今要知道：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我，惟有我是 神；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在我以外并无别神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使人死，我使人活；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我损伤，我也医治，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"并无人能从我手中救出来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向天举手说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我凭我的永生起誓：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我若磨我闪亮的刀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"手掌审判之权，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必报复我的敌人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报应恨我的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我的箭饮血饮醉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是被杀被掳之人的血。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的刀要吃肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乃是仇敌中首领之头的肉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"text":"你们外邦人当与主的百姓一同欢呼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因他要伸他仆人流血的冤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报应他的敌人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洁净他的地，救赎他的百姓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":["摩西和嫩的儿子约书亚去将这歌的一切话说给百姓听。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["摩西的最后训言"]},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":["摩西向以色列众人说完了这一切的话，"]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":["又说：「我今日所警教你们的，你们都要放在心上；要吩咐你们的子孙谨守遵行这律法上的话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":["因为这不是虚空、与你们无关的事，乃是你们的生命；在你们过约旦河要得为业的地上必因这事日子得以长久。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":["当日，耶和华吩咐摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":["「你上这亚巴琳山中的尼波山去，在摩押地与耶利哥相对，观看我所要赐给以色列人为业的迦南地。"]},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":["你必死在你所登的山上，归你列祖",{"noteId":8},"去，像你哥哥亚伦死在何珥山上，归他的列祖一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":["因为你们在寻的旷野，加低斯的米利巴水，在以色列人中没有尊我为圣，得罪了我。"]},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":["我所赐给以色列人的地，你可以远远地观看，却不得进去。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":8,"caller":"-","text":"原文是本民","reference":{"chapter":32,"verse":50}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/32.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/33.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/DEU/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":52}